            "review_text": "Maestripieri Timo\n3 contributions\n0\nAnother amazing experience\nJan 2026 • Couples\nI went for the second time last night and it was an amazing experience once again.\nThe staff is friendly and accommodating, the atmosphere is great and the food is sublime. The menu consists of regional products combined in interesting and surprising ways. the atmosphere at the chefs table is nice and familiar without losing track of professionalism. 10/10 will go again\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 22, 2026",
