            "review_text": "RobyOneK\nVerona, Italy221 contributions\n1\nUnique\nJan 2024 • Couples\nWe decided for it as marked by a well known international guide as “inventive Vietnamese cuisine”. It definitely kept its promise, especially if, as we did, you choose the set menu “Dhong” at Chef’s Table.\nThe present and the past of Vietnam’s elements, habits, traditional food, herbs, and unique ingredients are turning through the hands of Cuong Nguyen at his team , this extraordinary chef, into something really unforgettable .\nEat dish has been conceived and is dairy realised with maximum care and additional ingredients than those indicated, so the only chance to enjoy it is not listening or reviewing one’s suggestions , but going there .\nRead more\nWritten January 7, 2024\nAn's Saigon Team\nThank you very much for sharing details of your recent visit at An's.\nIt is great to know that we were able to provide you memorable gastronomic experience. We are constantly trying our best to sharpen the services to deliver quality experience to every one of our guests, and we really appreciate your candid opinion, which is valuable to us and motivates our team.\nWe hope to see you again in the future!\nRead more\nWritten February 21, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
